<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Features - Wireless Earbuds</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-cream: #FFFDF9;
            --bg-cream-soft: #FDFBF7;
            --card-white: #FFFFFF;
            --border-cream: #F1ECE1;
            --text-dark: #1C1917;
            --text-muted: #78716C;
            --accent-gold: #B45309;
            --shadow-cream: 0 15px 35px rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.06);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in forwards;
        }

        nav {
            background: rgba(255, 253, 249, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            padding: 1.2rem 3rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1150px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            animation: slideDown 0.6s ease-out;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: var(--card-white);
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-cream);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            animation: cardEntrance 0.8s ease forwards;
            opacity: 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .feature-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.25s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .feature-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.55s; }

        .feature-card::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            transform: scaleX(0);
            transition: transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-12px);
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.12);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .feature-card:hover::after {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }

        .icon-wrapper {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: var(--bg-cream-soft);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            animation: iconPulse 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 0.8rem 0;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.7;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Deep Spec Comparison Matrix */
        .comparison-section {
            margin-top: 5rem;
            background: var(--card-white);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-cream);
        }

        .comparison-section h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .comparison-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .comparison-table th, .comparison-table td {
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-cream);
            text-align: left;
        }

        .comparison-table th {
            background: var(--bg-cream-soft);
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; }
            to { opacity: 1; }
        }

        @keyframes slideDown {
            from { transform: translateY(-30px); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        }

        @keyframes cardEntrance {
            from { transform: translateY(40px); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        }

        @keyframes iconPulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-6px); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <div class="logo">AUDIO TECH</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="PRODUCT.html">Home</a>
            <a href="features.html" class="active">Features</a>
            <a href="reviews.html">Reviews</a>
            <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Tech & Acoustic Highlights</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Engineered for clarity, reliability, and all-day immersive acoustic performance.</p>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">🎵</div>
                <h3>Custom Sound Driver</h3>
                <p>High-amplitude dynamic drivers delivering deep, distortion-free bass and spatial audio support for complete studio immersion.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">🔇</div>
                <h3>Active Noise Cancellation</h3>
                <p>Adaptive ANC filters out environmental sound in real-time, reducing background noise by up to 35dB.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">⚡</div>
                <h3>40-Hour Battery Life</h3>
                <p>Enjoy up to 6 hours on a single charge, plus an additional 34 hours of playback from the compact charging case.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">🎙️</div>
                <h3>6-Microphone Array</h3>
                <p>Beamforming microphone technology suppresses wind noise and focuses on your voice for crystal-clear calls anywhere.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Detailed Feature Matrix -->
        <div class="comparison-section">
            <h2>Detailed Specification Breakdown</h2>
            <table class="comparison-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Feature Specification</th>
                        <th>Wireless Earbuds Standard</th>
                        <th>Competitor Average</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>ANC Reduction Depth</strong></td>
                        <td>Up to 35 dB Adaptive Blocking</td>
                        <td>25 dB Static Blocking</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Total Battery Reserve</strong></td>
                        <td>40 Hours (6h + 34h Case)</td>
                        <td>24 Hours</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Microphone Setup</strong></td>
                        <td>6-Microphone Beamforming Array</td>
                        <td>2-Microphone Standard</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Bluetooth Protocol</strong></td>
                        <td>Bluetooth 5.3 Low-Latency Audio</td>
                        <td>Bluetooth 5.0</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
